# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore: trims the monorepo build context for this
# image only, without affecting other images built from the repo root.
# Only go.mod/go.sum and Go sources matter to this build (no go:embed in the
# repo); excluding test data and non-Go subprojects avoids spurious rebuilds.
.git
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
node/txscript/data/
apps/
docs/
plonky2/
py-pearl-mining/
uv.lock
